  "questions": [
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u1:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u1",
      "unit_position": 1,
      "raw_text": "[哇R]分享一下之前面的百度\n面试官全程“拷打式提问”，从职业动机到框架理解，再到 channel 并发和算法，几乎覆盖了所有基础与实战点！",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u2:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u2",
      "unit_position": 2,
      "raw_text": "🎯 问题倾向\n整理下来，主要分三大类：\n① 职业与项目能力\n* 为什么突然想换公司\n* 什么是好平台？如何体现自己的核心能力\n* 如果现在需要开发一个核心系统，你如何证明自己能胜任\n👉 倾向点：面试官在考察 职业动机、思考逻辑、项目经验与落地能力，不是随口说说",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u3:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u3",
      "unit_position": 3,
      "raw_text": "② Go 技术 & 框架\n* 讲一下 go-zero 框架\n* 如果需要引用数据库中间件，该如何改进？\n* channel 基础：容量是 100，写入满了还能写第 101 个吗？\n* 项目拷打：项目背景、核心模块、解决方案\n👉 倾向点：考察 框架理解、并发基础、工程实践经验\n* channel 问题 → 测试你对 阻塞写入/非阻塞、select、缓冲区 的理解\n* go-zero → 微服务、RPC、代码生成、容错、服务注册",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u7:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u7",
      "unit_position": 7,
      "raw_text": "1. 职业问题要有逻辑：换公司/胜任问题，要结合个人经历 + 技术能力 + 项目案例，不要空泛",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u8:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u8",
      "unit_position": 8,
      "raw_text": "2. go-zero 框架：微服务、RPC、服务注册、容错、中间件，都要能口头复述流程",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u9:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u9",
      "unit_position": 9,
      "raw_text": "3. channel 并发：容量满写、select、阻塞/非阻塞、超时控制、实际应用场景，都要讲清楚",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u10:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u10",
      "unit_position": 10,
      "raw_text": "4. 算法题：不仅能写，还要 口述复杂度分析，展示对性能的理解",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
